-- Demo machine: the writer drafts, then recreates, in turn. A second draft before a recreate (or
-- a recreate first) is refused, and so is any other Notion write, which examples/demo/draft.yaml
-- translates to `other` (not in this spec). Complier doesn't observe Notion, so nothing here waits
-- on the world.
WRITER = !draft -> !recreate -> WRITER
